# Trained model artifacts are stored through Git LFS: a single versioned
# RandomForest artifact is ~50 MB, which is too large for a normal git blob.
#
# Only the newest version of each task is kept in the repository because the
# application loads only the latest version (see src/services/scoring_service.py).
#
# NOTE: the deployment platform must have Git LFS enabled for the project,
# otherwise these files arrive as pointer text and the model-serving pages
# report the models as unavailable.
*.joblib filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
